{"ref":"powerup:revival","lead":[{"k":"figure","i":"Sprite-Revival.png","w":128,"h":128,"c":[]},{"k":"p","c":["Revival is one of the player stats in Vampire Survivors. Each point of Revival a player has allows them to revive once upon death with 50% of their ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["The player has 0 base Revivals before modifications. Bonuses to Revival are flat bonuses and thus stack additively."]},{"k":"p","c":["There is no upper limit to how many Revivals the player may have."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"PowerUp","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["5 February 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["REVIVAL"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["1"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["+1"]]},{"label":"Initial cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 10,000"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["If the player dies and has at least 1 Revival, instead of getting the usual \"Quit\" button to return to the main menu, they will instead be greeted with a \"Revive\" button. An animation is played and the player resumes control of their character exactly where they left off, with 50% of their ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," also being restored. The player is additionally given a large amount of invulnerability frames. The health gained upon reviving counts as healing, causing it to interact with effects related to restoring health, such as ",{"i":"Sprite-Soul_Eater.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:soul-eater"}," ",{"t":"Soul Eater","r":"weapon:soul-eater"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Sarabande_of_Healing_(VI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," ",{"t":"Sarabande of Healing (VI)","r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["If Revivals are carried to the end of the game, the player will still be allowed to Revive after being killed by ",{"i":"Sprite-The_Reaper.png","w":20,"h":24}," The Reaper. Every Revival used like this will add gold to the bonus gold for completing the stage, at +100 gold per revival, increasing by 100 for every additional revival used. For example, if the player has 3 revivals and use them all on The Reaper, they will die and get the normal 500 bonus gold, then revive and die and get an extra 100, then an extra 200, then an extra 300, and end the round with 1100 bonus gold. The scaling gold increase caps at 400 and any additional unused Revivals will only give 100 bonus gold."]},{"k":"p","c":["Revival also affects:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Base Damage and ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," of ",{"i":"Sprite-Phieraggi.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," ",{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"}]},{"c":["Base Damage of ",{"i":"Sprite-Meal_Ticket.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," ",{"t":"Meal Ticket","r":"weapon:meal-ticket"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]}]}],"subs":[{"id":"effects-on-revival","title":"On Revival","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["On Revival or On Revive is a mechanic in Vampire Survivors where a specific character or item triggers a special skill or mechanic immediately after being revived. For example, ",{"i":"Sprite-Malice_Bloodmoon.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"character:malice-bloodmoon"}," ",{"t":"Malice Bloodmoon","r":"character:malice-bloodmoon"}," triggers a ",{"t":"Blood Hex","r":"weapon:blood-hex"}," on revival."]}]}]},{"id":"powerup","title":"PowerUp","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The Revival PowerUp increases Revival by 1, and only has one rank. It initially costs ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 10,000."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Rank"],"h":1},{"c":["Revival"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1"]},{"c":["+1"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-items","title":"From items","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Revival's associated passive item is ",{"i":"Sprite-Tirajisú.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:tirajisu"}," ",{"t":"Tirajisú","r":"passive:tirajisu"},", which provides 1 additional revival per level, up to a maximum of 2 at level 2."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Golden_Egg.png","w":22,"h":24}," Golden Eggs can permanently increase Revival by 0.1 for the character that collected it."]},{"c":["Survarot cards featuring ",{"i":"Sprite-Pasqualina_Belpaese.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:pasqualina-belpaese"}," ",{"t":"Pasqualina Belpaese","r":"character:pasqualina-belpaese"}," provide +1 Revival upon selection. The card's ",{"i":"Sprite-Gala.png","w":64,"h":17}," edition-exclusive skill (or any ",{"i":"Sprite-Foil.png","w":64,"h":17}," edition card as a random bonus) can grant up to +3 Revivals after reaching certain kill thresholds."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Academy_Badge.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:academy-badge"}," ",{"t":"Academy Badge","r":"passive:academy-badge"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-TidesOfTheFoscari.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Tides of the Foscari DLC to access"}," has 6 levels and provides +1 Revival at levels 3 and 5, for a maximum of +2 Revival."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Paranormal_Scan.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"t":"Paranormal Scan","r":"weapon:paranormal-scan"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmergencyMeeting.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emergency Meeting DLC to access"}," may provide 0.2 Revival whenever it activates, requiring 5 such bonuses to give +1 Revival, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Weapon_Power-Up.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}," ",{"t":"Weapon Power-Up","r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OperationGuns.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Operation Guns DLC to access"}," provides +1 Revival on pickup."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-arcana","title":"From arcana","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," provides +3 Revivals when chosen and gives +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"},", +1 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},", and +5% ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"}," per Revival consumed."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Hidden_Anathema_(III).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:hidden-anathema-iii"}," ",{"t":"Hidden Anathema (III)","r":"arcana:hidden-anathema-iii"}," may provide additional Revivals when obtaining food-based Pickups, with no cap."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"from-characters","title":"From characters","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"from-characters-base-game","title":"Base Game","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Krochi_Freetto.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:krochi-freetto"}," ",{"t":"Krochi Freetto","r":"character:krochi-freetto"}," starts with +1 Revival and gains +1 Revival at level 33, for a total of +2 Revivals."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Cosmo_Pavone.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:cosmo-pavone"}," ",{"t":"Cosmo Pavone","r":"character:cosmo-pavone"}," starts with +1 Revival and gains +1 Revival every 100 levels, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gyorunton.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:gyorunton"}," ",{"t":"Gyorunton","r":"character:gyorunton"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Bats_Bats_Bats.png","w":24,"h":16,"r":"character:bats-bats-bats"}," ",{"t":"Bats Bats Bats","r":"character:bats-bats-bats"}," both start with +2 Revivals."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Queen_Sigma.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:queen-sigma"}," ",{"t":"Queen Sigma","r":"character:queen-sigma"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Avatar_Infernas.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:avatar-infernas"}," ",{"t":"Avatar Infernas","r":"character:avatar-infernas"}," both start with +1 Revival."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Gazebo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:gazebo"}," ",{"t":"Gazebo","r":"character:gazebo"}," may gain additional Revivals when Overhealing, up to a cap of +3 Revivals."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Reborn_She-Moon_Eeta.png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"character:she-moon-eeta"}," ",{"t":"Reborn She-Moon Eeta","r":"character:she-moon-eeta"}," starts with +7 Revivals."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-tides-of-the-foscari","title":"Tides of the Foscari","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Luminaire_Foscari.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:luminaire-foscari"}," ",{"t":"Luminaire Foscari","r":"character:luminaire-foscari"}," starts with +7 Revivals."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-emergency-meeting","title":"Emergency Meeting","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Crewmate_Dino.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:crewmate-dino"}," ",{"t":"Crewmate Dino","r":"character:crewmate-dino"}," has a chance to gain a random amount of Revivals every time a passive item is upgraded to its maximum level, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Guardian_Pina.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:guardian-pina"}," ",{"t":"Guardian Pina","r":"character:guardian-pina"}," starts with +1 Revival, and has a chance to gain +1 Revival when anyone, including Pina themself, revives."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-operation-guns","title":"Operation Guns","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Lucia_Zero.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:lucia-zero"}," ",{"t":"Lucia Zero","r":"character:lucia-zero"}," starts with +1 Revival."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-ode-to-castlevania","title":"Ode to Castlevania","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Leon_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:leon-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Leon","r":"character:leon-belmont"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Christopher_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:christopher-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Christopher","r":"character:christopher-belmont"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Simon_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:simon-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Simon","r":"character:simon-belmont"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Julius_Belmont.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:julius-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Julius","r":"character:julius-belmont"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Shaft.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:shaft"}," ",{"t":"Shaft","r":"character:shaft"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Master_Librarian.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"character:master-librarian"}," ",{"t":"Master Librarian","r":"character:master-librarian"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Soleil_Belmont.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"character:soleil-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Soleil","r":"character:soleil-belmont"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Galamoth.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"character:galamoth"}," ",{"t":"Galamoth","r":"character:galamoth"}," all start with +1 Revival."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Leon_Belmont.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:leon-belmont"}," ",{"t":"Leon","r":"character:leon-belmont"}," also gains +1 Revival upon obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Vampire_Killer.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vampire-killer"}," ",{"t":"Vampire Killer","r":"weapon:vampire-killer"},", for a total of +2 Revivals."]}]}},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Quincy_Morris.png","w":23,"h":24,"r":"character:quincy-morris"}," ",{"t":"Quincy Morris","r":"character:quincy-morris"}," starts with +4 Revivals."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Vlad_Tepes_Dracula.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"}," ",{"t":"Vlad Tepes Dracula","r":"character:vlad-tepes-dracula"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Megalo_Dracula.png","w":24,"h":12,"r":"character:megalo-dracula"}," ",{"t":"Megalo Dracula","r":"character:megalo-dracula"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Dark_Lord_Soma_Cruz.png","w":15,"h":24,"r":"character:soma-cruz"}," ",{"t":"Dark Lord Soma Cruz","r":"character:soma-cruz"}," gain +1 Revival every 100 levels, with no cap."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Nathan_Graves.png","w":21,"h":24,"r":"character:nathan-graves"}," ",{"t":"Nathan Graves","r":"character:nathan-graves"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:chaos"}," ",{"t":"Chaos","r":"character:chaos"}," both start with ",{"i":"Sprite-Awake_(IV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," ",{"t":"Awake (IV)","r":"arcana:awake-iv"}," and thus start with +3 Revivals."]}]}]},{"id":"from-characters-emerald-diorama","title":"Emerald Diorama","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Dolores.png","w":24,"h":20,"r":"character:dolores"}," ",{"t":"Dolores","r":"character:dolores"}," starts with +1 Revival."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Lolo,_Hiss,_Meow,_and_Purr.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:lolo-hiss-meow-and-purr"}," ",{"t":"Lolo, Hiss, Meow, and Purr","r":"character:lolo-hiss-meow-and-purr"}," start with +8 Revivals."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Kugutsu.png","w":23,"h":24}," Kugutsu gain +1 Revival and +5% ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"}," every time they Glimmer a new tech, up to a maximum of +35 Revivals (and +175% Growth) should they collect and Glimmer all compatible weaponry."]}]}]}]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Revivals are a powerful tool that can save runs. While they provide no benefit until you die (except for ",{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"},"), they can save the player from sloppy mistakes and being suddenly overwhelmed."]},{"c":[{"t":"Phieraggi","r":"weapon:phieraggi"}," benefits from this stat by getting +X Base Damage and +X ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," equal to the value of this stat. Be sure not to use up revives to achive that weapons maximum effectiveness."]},{"c":["Revivals are especially useful when playing as characters with less survivability, such as ",{"t":"Exdash","r":"character:exdash-exiviiq"}," and ",{"t":"Toastie","r":"character:toastie"},"."]},{"c":["Revival stat is additive. The maximum amount of Revivals a player can have can be obtained by getting the PowerUp (+1), Level 2 Tirajisú (+2), playing as Krochi or Gyorunton (+2), and taking the Awake (IV) Arcana (+3), netting +8 extra lives. If these are taken to the end of the round and exchanged with The Reaper for extra gold, they will be worth +1900 bonus gold altogether."]},{"c":["Revivals can be especially useful for runs where the goal is to survive as long as possible against The Reaper, and can greatly extend runs when paired with other defensive measures."]},{"c":["Revivals can be useful for gathering loot otherwise unobtainable before The Reaper ends the run. Even 1 revival can allow the player to get a few more levels or one extra Treasure Chest."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Animated-Revival_Angel.gif","w":168,"h":196,"c":["Animation played upon reviving."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 17 August 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fix for revives triggering twice."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 2 September 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Option to cash-in immediately all remaining Revives when completing a stage."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 9 June 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed Bonus Revivals from Golden Eggs not working"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 5 February 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}